---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Why Choose Burnham Nationwide" description="What sets Burnham Nationwide apart: its people, its values and more than 30 years of permit and code expertise serving major corporations and leading architecture firms nationwide." nav="about">
  <div class="page-band">
    <div class="wrap">
      <ol class="crumbs"><li><a href="/">Home</a></li><li>About</li><li>Why Burnham</li></ol>
      <nav aria-label="About Burnham"><a href="/about/why-burnham/" aria-current="page">Why Burnham</a><a href="/about/team/">Team</a><a href="/about/history/">History</a><a href="/about/testimonials/">Testimonials</a><a href="/about/careers/">Careers</a><a href="/diversity-inclusion/">Diversity</a><a href="/about/faq/">FAQ</a></nav>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Who we are</div>
        <h1 class="h-display">Permit and code experts behind iconic buildings.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Burnham Nationwide’s permit expediters and code consultants have worked on a host of landmark buildings and complex projects over the last three decades. Whether a new skyscraper, a historic landmark alteration or a national retail rollout, the team navigates the permit and code compliance process on behalf of major corporations and leading development and architecture firms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="media media--tall"><img src="/assets/img/about/office.jpg" alt="Four Burnham team members reviewing a large site plan around a conference table" width="1600" height="1066"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <figure class="stack stack--sm" style="margin: 0;">
        <div class="media"><img src="/assets/img/about/founders.jpg" alt="Founders Mike Gaynor and Carson Kyhl in Burnham polo shirts, early 1990s" width="1600" height="1273" loading="lazy"></div>
        <figcaption class="small">Founders Mike Gaynor (left) and Carson Kyhl (right).</figcaption>
      </figure>
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">The founders</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Inspired by Daniel Burnham and the Plan of Chicago.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Carson Kyhl and Mike Gaynor named the firm for architect and urban planner Daniel Burnham and the legacy of his visionary Plan of Chicago. Burnham Nationwide contributes to beautiful, safe and efficient buildings and communities by helping clients’ plans become reality.</p>
        <div class="callout">
          <div class="callout__title">Our mission</div>
          <div class="callout__body">To be a special experience for every client and every project, every time.</div>
        </div>
        <div><a class="link" href="/about/history/">Read our history</a></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap stack stack--lg">
      <div class="stack stack--sm section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">How we work</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">What clients can expect.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid--4">
        <article class="card">
          <h3 class="h-sm">Expertise you can trust</h3>
          <p class="body">Process-oriented experts with more than 30 years of experience and a national reach, speaking with confidence and candor. Burnham has invested in technology to keep improving its processes and services.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3 class="h-sm">On your team</h3>
          <p class="body">Like the team members you wish you could hire full time: attentive to the small things and quick to act.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3 class="h-sm">Transparent</h3>
          <p class="body">Visibility and clarity, never surprises. Burnham manages expectations by communicating where delays can occur, what can be done and when things change.</p>
        </article>
        <article class="card">
          <h3 class="h-sm">The job gets done</h3>
          <p class="body">Things come up and plans change. Burnham stays committed to the outcome, handling submissions and offering expert guidance when it matters.</p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="wrap grid grid--2 grid--center">
      <div class="stack">
        <div class="eyebrow">Our people</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">The difference is the people.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Burnham brings a human touch to a process that can be cumbersome and tedious. Every employee is committed to improving the client experience, taking ownership of each project from start to finish and following through on the promise to simply get it done.</p>
        <div><a class="link" href="/about/team/">Meet the team</a></div>
      </div>
      <div class="media media--tall"><img src="/assets/img/about/our-people.jpg" alt="A Burnham manager and a client hold up a City of Chicago building permit in the Burnham office" width="1600" height="1200" loading="lazy"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap stack stack--lg">
      <div class="stack stack--sm section-head">
        <div class="eyebrow">Our values</div>
        <h2 class="h-section">Values driving results.</h2>
        <p class="lede">Four guiding principles shape the work, personally and professionally, every day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid--4">
        <div class="value"><h3 class="h-sm">Caring for people</h3><p class="body">Appreciating every stakeholder, their role and responsibility, and always working to support one another effectively and efficiently.</p></div>
        <div class="value"><h3 class="h-sm">Leading through innovation</h3><p class="body">Recognizing that success and growth come from creating new and better processes.</p></div>
        <div class="value"><h3 class="h-sm">Improving productivity</h3><p class="body">Learning from experience and practicing tenacious problem solving.</p></div>
        <div class="value"><h3 class="h-sm">Perfecting customer service</h3><p class="body">Taking ownership of client satisfaction by consistently meeting or exceeding expectations.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--muted">
    <div class="wrap stack stack--lg">
      <div class="row row--between">
        <div class="stack stack--sm section-head">
          <div class="eyebrow">Testimonials</div>
          <h2 class="h-section">Success built on trust.</h2>
        </div>
        <a class="link" href="/about/testimonials/">All testimonials</a>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid--2" style="--gap: 24px;">
        <figure class="quote">
          <blockquote>“Burnham have been a trusted and important partner to Joe &amp; The Juice in a period of heavy expansion with +30 openings in 2018.”</blockquote>
          <figcaption><strong>Valdemar Halbye</strong>Head of US Retail, Joe &amp; The Juice</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="quote">
          <blockquote>“Burnham has always provided excellent service, communication and follow up. Burnham has always been my go to expeditor.”</blockquote>
          <figcaption><strong>Ellie Z</strong>Clune Construction</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="quote">
          <blockquote>“We rely on Burnham Nationwide for a large majority of our projects. Their responsiveness to emails and effectiveness in executing the permit is extremely valuable. Our retail projects are fast-paced and thrive through Burnham Nationwide's expertise.”</blockquote>
          <figcaption><strong>Lindsay H</strong>BKA Architects</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="quote">
          <blockquote>“Collaborating with the Burnham team has been a terrific experience. They have a forward-thinking staff with great ideas and excited to work with them on future content and events.”</blockquote>
          <figcaption><strong>Jon D</strong>Cushing Company</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap cta-block">
      <div class="stack stack--sm">
        <h2>Put an experienced team on your project.</h2>
        <p>Tell us the address and scope, and a project manager will map the path to approval.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <a class="btn btn--primary" href="/contact/">Start a project</a>
        <a class="btn btn--on-dark" href="/portfolio/">See our work</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
